    "sentence_translations": [
      "Small Talk at Parties",
      "",
      "Xiaohong: Duoduo, this is the best party I've ever been to! Thank you for inviting me!",
      "",
      "Duoduo: Xiaohong, I am so happy that you could make it and are having fun here. Your earrings are exquisite!",
      "",
      "Xiaohong: Thank you! I made them myself. It is very easy. If you like, I can make a pair for you next time.",
      "",
      "Duoduo: You are so clever with your hands. You can make everything by yourself. I could learn a lot from you.",
      "",
      "Xiaohong: You flatter me! Actually I admire you!",
      "Gathering all these people together and throwing such a big party, you are awesome!",
      "",
      "Duoduo: That is because everyone gives me face!",
      "Please make yourself comfortable and look around. Excuse me for a moment.",
      "",
      "Xiaohong: Sure. You go ahead and take care of your business. You don't need to keep me company.",
      "",
      "Duoduo: Yeah, see you in a bit!",
      ""
    ]
